ser\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"@types/ws\": \"^8.5.0\",\n    \"@types/better-sqlite3\": \"^7.6.0\",\n    \"@types/express\": \"^4.17.0\",\n    \"supertest\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"@types/supertest\": \"^6.0.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Key observations:**\n- ESM project (`\"type\": \"module\"`)\n- Three runtime dependencies: `ws` (WebSocket), `better-sqlite3` (SQLite), `express` (HTTP)\n- Testing via `vitest` with `supertest` for HTTP testing\n- **`node_modules/` does NOT exist** -- dependencies need to be installed (`npm install`)\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/tsconfig.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"module\": \"Node16\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"Node16\",\n    \"outDir\": \"./dist\",\n    \"rootDir\": \"./src\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"declarationMap\": true,\n    \"sourceMap\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"tests\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Key observations:**\n- Strict mode enabled\n- Compiles from `src/` to `dist/`\n- Node16 module resolution (required for ESM with TypeScript)\n- Generates declaration files and source maps\n- Tests directory is explicitly excluded from compilation\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/.eslintrc.cjs`\n\n```javascript\nmodule.exports = {\n  parser: '@typescript-eslint/parser',\n  plugins: ['@typescript-eslint'],\n  extends: ['eslint:recommended', 'plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended'],\n  parserOptions: {\n    ecmaVersion: 2022,\n    sourceType: 'module',\n  },\n  rules: {\n    '@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars': ['error', { argsIgnorePattern: '^_' }],\n  },\n  env: {\n    node: true,\n    es2022: true,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**Key observations:**\n- Uses `@typescript-eslint/recommended` rules\n- Unused variables are errors (but `_`-